# my-cdd minimal default profile for Debian 13.
# Do NOT copy Simple-CDD upstream default.preseed wholesale: it has many
# debconf answers (tasksel, hostname, partman, clock, finish-install) that
# suppress or alter ordinary interactive Debian Installer prompts.
#
# This single early command is Simple-CDD 0.6.9's essential bootstrap.
# The profile-summary confirmation MUST be integrated into the
# simple-cdd-profiles udeb BEFORE it loads/queues profile actions.
d-i preseed/early_command string anna-install simple-cdd-profiles
